                                                "sense_id": "8623c43e-a296-36ac-b88d-827fe464dc21",
                                                "text": "A weather-worn Vauxhall thirty landaulette was awaiting us, and bumped us for six or seven miles over by-paths and lanes which, in spite of their natural seclusion, were deeply rutted and showed every sign of heavy traffic."
